{"2474930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bleak Frontier", "steam_appid": 2474930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1785373870\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bleak Frontier is a strategy / city builder game set in a frozen wasteland in the far future, 4087 AD. As the chosen leader of the first permanent settlement in almost a century, you must guide the last survivors of the human race towards an uncertain future.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/ee3450fcefe2f42a6456d513807e556a.poster.avif?t=1785373870\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/ee3450fcefe2f42a6456d513807e556a.webm?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/ee3450fcefe2f42a6456d513807e556a.mp4?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>SURVIVE</strong> a vast frozen wasteland in the far future, 4087 AD.</li><li><strong>FOUND</strong> a new civilization using a mysterious artifact.</li><li><strong>BUILD</strong> a variety of different structures across multiple distinct eras</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/bc03a7de9d95de39b1d2399e01d97880.poster.avif?t=1785373870\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/bc03a7de9d95de39b1d2399e01d97880.webm?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/bc03a7de9d95de39b1d2399e01d97880.mp4?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>EXPAND</strong> your territory to harvest new resources.</li><li><strong>RESEARCH</strong> technologies to improve your structures.</li><li><strong>DEFEND</strong> against raider attacks with defensive structures and fortifications</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/0a57f1f238203ea12f9d138b93e16a88.poster.avif?t=1785373870\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/0a57f1f238203ea12f9d138b93e16a88.webm?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/0a57f1f238203ea12f9d138b93e16a88.mp4?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>MOBILIZE</strong> convoys to defend your towns, attack raider camps, and explore ancient ruins.</li><li><strong>SALVAGE</strong> vehicles, survivors and resources from the wastes.</li><li><strong>COLLECT</strong> powerful artifacts and learn Earth's forgotten history.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/d2f887ff0964ae86a4c35e4e7a429b7c.poster.avif?t=1785373870\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/d2f887ff0964ae86a4c35e4e7a429b7c.webm?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/d2f887ff0964ae86a4c35e4e7a429b7c.mp4?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><li><strong>LISTEN</strong> to the original soundtrack composed by synthwave producer Rogue VHS.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/652be2bfdd9132246d4a3832a107d5c6.avif?t=1785373870\" width=600 height=240 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1785373870\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1785373870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Bleak Frontier is a strategy / city builder game set in a frozen wasteland in the far future, 4087 AD. As the chosen leader of the first permanent settlement in almost a century, you must guide the last survivors of the human race towards an uncertain future.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474930/extras/ee3450fcefe2f42a6456d513807e556a.poster.avif?t=1785373870\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.